<title>JAPAN: Daishi Bank - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Daishi Bank - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    55.28		vs	   68.58</p>
<p> Operating	    9.91		vs	   11.52</p>
<p> Current		8.21		vs	    6.45</p>
<p> Net		    8.06		vs	    2.47</p>
<p> EPS		   20.27 yen	  vs	    7.45 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    398 million	  vs	 331 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Daishi Bank Ltd is a Niigata-based regional bank.</p>
</text>
